+++ b/doc/stunnel.html.in
@@ -326,7 +326,7 @@ only meant to be understood by stunnel developers, and not by users.
 Please either use the debug level when requested to do so by an stunnel
 developer, or when you intend to get confused.</p>
 <p>The default logging level is notice (5).</p>
-<p>The syslog ‘daemon’ facility will be used unless a facility name is
+<p>The syslog ‘authpriv’ facility will be used unless a facility name is
