diff --git a/doc/stunnel.md b/doc/stunnel.md
index 6ad562b..9205950 100644
--- a/doc/stunnel.md
+++ b/doc/stunnel.md
@@ -142,7 +142,7 @@ An address parameter of an option may be either:
 
